.Dd July 26, 2026
.Dt SAVE 8
.Os FreeBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm save
.Nd save workspace state to git with two-commit capture
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl s Ar name
.Op Fl k Ar kind
.Op Fl m Ar msg
.Op Fl h
.Op Fl d
.Op Fl q
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility is part of the parasa framework for FreeBSD system management.
It captures the current state of a deployed system or container into
two git commits: one for the tree state and one for the recipe metadata.
.Pp
The save proceeds as follows:
.Bl -enum
.It
Run
.Xr diff 8
to verify all changes are classified.
.It
Capture the installed package list using
.Xr pkg-info 8
and write it to
.Pa pkg.list .
.It
Regenerate
.Pa mtree.dist
using
.Xr mtree 8 .
.It
Commit 1 (state): in the tree root, stage all changes and commit
with the artifact name and admin message.
Push to
.Pa foundation.git .
.It
Commit 2 (recipe): in the parasa directory, stage the recipe directory
and commit with the workspace name and admin message.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-m MSG"
.It Fl h
Print a usage summary and exit.
.It Fl d
Dry run.
Show what would be done without making changes.
.It Fl s Ar name
Specify the workspace name.
This option is required.
.It Fl k Ar kind
Specify "system" or "container".
Auto-detected from recipes directory if omitted.
.It Fl m Ar msg
Commit message.
Required in quiet mode.
.It Fl q
Quiet mode.
No interactive prompts.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "recipes/{kind}s/<name>/pkg.list"
.It Pa recipes/{kind}s/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac Ns Pa /pkg.list
Package origin list captured by save.
.It Pa recipes/{kind}s/ Ns Ao Ar name Ac Ns Pa /mtree.dist
Regenerated filesystem specification.
.It Pa zbamidbar/foundation.git
Git repository where state commits are pushed.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr diff 8 ,
.Xr update 8 ,
.Xr pkg-info 8 ,
.Xr mtree 8
.Sh AUTHORS
The
.Nm
utility is part of the parasa framework.
